### Kevalon Accounting ERP Backend - Module 21 — Workflow & Approval (Maker-Checker)

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = 6a7c193d269f35cc68af0916
@accountantRoleId = 6a7c193d269f35cc68af0917
@approverUserId = 6a7c193d269f35cc68af0916
@taskId = 6a7c193e269f35cc68af0959

### 1. POST /api/approval/config - Create or Update Approval Rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/approval/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "module": "PURCHASE_ORDER",
  "thresholdAmount": 10000,
  "levels": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "roleId": "{{accountantRoleId}}"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "userIds": ["{{approverUserId}}"]
    }
  ],
  "escalationEnabled": true,
  "escalationAfterHours": 24
}

### 2. GET /api/approval/pending - Get Pending Approval Tasks for a User
GET {{baseUrl}}/approval/pending?userId={{approverUserId}}&companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. PUT /api/approval/:id/approve - Approve Task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/approval/{{taskId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Verified rates against supplier contract and matches terms."
}

### 4. PUT /api/approval/:id/reject - Reject Task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/approval/{{taskId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Unit prices are above negotiated contract rates."
}

### 5. GET /api/approval/:id/history - Get Approval and Escalation Audit History
GET {{baseUrl}}/approval/{{taskId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
